SCRIPT:mgfotr_rohanguy022
"The forces of the enemy do not relent!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_rohanguy023
"Prince Theodred, we must retreat to higher ground!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred031
"Retreat!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_rohanguy024
"Royal Guard: Sire! They seek to trap us here!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred023
"Theodred: He commands the enemy! We must put an end to him to break their will!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_mog001
"Mog: Strawheads!  Now you will see what Saruman has wrought!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred016
"Come, you orc scum. I will fell you where you stand!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_mog002
"Cut off his head!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_mog003
"You will die here!!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_mog004
"We will boil the flesh off your bones!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_mog005
"The White Hand will have you!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_mog006
"To me! Cut them down!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred001
"Rohirrim! Ride now across the Isen!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred002
"We will send these vile orcs back to the pits of Isengard!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred003
"Grimbold, I am pleased to see you have held the enemy back."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred004
"So it seems. Let us destroy these foul creatures, ere they regroup in the trees."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred005
"Their attacks have paused."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred006
"I will take what riders remain, and go to the gates of Isengard."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred007
"Saruman must answer for his warmongering!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred008
"The Road to Isengard is this way! Come!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred009
"There! I can see the Gates of Isengard ahead."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred010
"Theodred: Do not waste my time, orc! Tell your master to come forward!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred011
"Ambush! We're outnumbered! We must retreat to the Fords with all haste!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred012
"Look out!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred013
"Grimbold! We have been misled!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred014
"Saruman has amassed a great army of men and orcs. We cannot allow them to cross the Isen."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred015
"Again the enemy drives forward. We must take our last stand here!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred017
"Their forces do not wane!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred018
"The voice of their master drives them..."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred019
"Keep them at bay!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred020
"Theodred: Push them back, sons of Rohan!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred021
"Theodred: For the Mark!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred022
"Theodred: Let me lie here... to hold the Ford... until Eomer comes..."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred024
"Follow me, Men of Rohan!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred025
"Archers! We are in need of your assistance. Rally to the Fords of Isen with all haste!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred026
"These wretched lumber mills fuel the fires of Isengard! Let us put an end to them!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred027
"Return to Wulfgar and tell him you have failed!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred028
"Raze their camp to the ground!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred029
"Pikes! We must find another way!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_theodred030
"The Wildmen camps have been destroyed. That should relieve our forces at the Fords."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold001
"Grimbold: The forces of Isengard have gathered at our doorstep."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold002
"Grimbold: Saruman has sent a host of men to take control of the fords of Isen and allow him to invade Rohan."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold003
"Grimbold: We must hold these Fords until Theodred returns with aid."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold004
"To battle, sons of Eorl!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold005
"My lord Theodred! Your arrival is most timely."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold006
"Aye! Men, push forward!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold007
"They shall feel the bite of our blades! Men, ready yourselves!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold008
"Grimbold: Their attack seems to have slowed, we should call upon more troops to bolster our defences."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold009
"Grimbold: Theodred... No!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold010
"Grimbold: Men... Avenge your prince!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold011
"Our allies have arrived, we may yet survive this day!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold012
"Grimbold: I will not let him pass this way unchallenged..."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold013
"Grimbold: My lord Erkenbrand... let me maintain a small garrison here so that the enemy may be delayed."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold014
"Return to the pits that spawned you!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold015
"Rohan shall never fall!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold016
"Your master will never prevail!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold017
"Wargs!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold018
"We're being flanked!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold019
"The forces of Isengard have reached the Western Bank! We must rout them!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold020
"You and your kind will never take the Riddermark!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold021
"These Fords will be your grave!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold022
"Forward, Men of Rohan!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold023
"They are an endless tide!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold024
"Grimbold: There is a village to the north of here. We should send riders there to muster what men we can."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold025
"Grimbold: We should explore the forest to the North-east while we still can."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_grimbold026
"Grimbold: Saruman exploits these woods for fuel and we may yet have a chance to find and destroy his lumber camps."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_elfhelm001
"Riders! Defend the Prince! Charge!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_elfhelm002
"Stain the Isen with their blood!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_elfhelm003
"Elfhelm: Rest now... Theodred... son of Theoden."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_elfhelm004
"Elfhelm: Soon you shall bask in the presence of your forebears."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_elfhelm005
"Elfhelm: If Saruman wants to secure the Fords for himself we will not be able to stop him."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_elfhelm006
"Elfhelm: We must retreat and bolster our forces elsewhere."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_erkenbrand001
"To battle, Men of the Westfold!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_erkenbrand002
"The forces of Isengard scatter like rats!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_erkenbrand003
"We are victorious this day!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_erkenbrand004
"Erkenbrand: This was but a glimpse of the depths of Saruman's treachery."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_erkenbrand005
"Erkenbrand: Wulfgar of Dunland has pledged his warriors to the wizard's cause, and everyday \n more orcs come down from the mountains and from the darkening east..."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_rohanguy002
"Rohirrim: The orcs are too many, and more keep coming! If we do not rally soon we shall all be slain!"
End

SCRIPT:Counter_Buildings
"Structures left to build: "
End
